 DevOps Engineer Interview experience at Brillio (2nd round)🚀

After Round 1 (40 mins), I had Round 2 (approx 1 hour) which was more scenario-based and focused on AWS, Kubernetes, and Databases. Here are the questions asked:

🔹 AWS Certificate Manager (ACM)
Your website hosted on ALB is showing SSL certificate expired even though issued via ACM. How do you troubleshoot & fix?
You want to use a certificate in EC2 with Nginx/Apache, but ACM does not allow export. How will you handle this?
You have multiple domains & subdomains. How would you manage ACM certificates efficiently?
A certificate in ACM is stuck in Pending validation. What steps would you take?
How to rotate SSL certificates in production with zero downtime?

🔹 AWS S3
Your application writes logs to S3 but some objects are missing. How do you debug?
Migrate 50 TB data from one S3 bucket (Account A) to another (Account B) with zero downtime – approaches?
Website hosted on S3 + CloudFront is showing Access Denied. How do you troubleshoot policies/roles?
A critical dataset in S3 was accidentally deleted. How do you ensure recovery?
Implement lifecycle policies: logs archived to Glacier, deleted after 1 year – how?

🔹 Kubernetes / EKS
Pods stuck in CrashLoopBackOff – how to debug & fix?
During peak traffic, latency issues occur even though CPU/Memory look fine. Troubleshooting steps?
A service via Ingress is giving 502 Bad Gateway. Debugging approach?
After a new deployment, users face downtime. How to ensure zero-downtime deployments in K8s?
Secrets management in K8s – would you choose K8s Secrets, AWS Secrets Manager, or SSM Parameter Store & why?

🔹 AWS RDS
RDS MySQL facing high CPU during peak hours – how do you analyze & optimize?
RDS storage reached 100% full, queries failing. Immediate steps?
During deployment, RDS connections dropped briefly. How to configure HA/failover?
How to upgrade RDS instance type with minimum downtime?
Heavy read workload – how do you enable read scalability in RDS?

🔹 AWS DynamoDB
DynamoDB table facing ThrottlingExceptions in peak traffic – resolution?
Application showing eventual consistency issues – how to change read strategy?
Migrate 1 TB data from RDS to DynamoDB with minimal downtime – approach?
Restore a DynamoDB backup into another AWS account – how?
Design a multi-tenant DynamoDB table with scalability – how to define partition/sort key?

✨ This round focused heavily on real-world troubleshooting, high availability, scalability, and best practices.
